          %h3#for_ordinary_cohomology For ordinary cohomology
          %p
            Named after
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+Leray"} Jean Leray
            and Guy Hirsch.
          %p
            Review of the theorem for
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+cohomology"} ordinary cohomology
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alan+Hatcher"}> Alan Hatcher
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "https://www.math.cornell.edu/~hatcher/AT/ATpage.html"} Algebraic topology
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.math.cornell.edu/~hatcher/AT/ATch4.4.pdf"} pdf
            %li#Ebert12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Johannes+Ebert"}> Johannes Ebert
                , section 2.3 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A lecture course on Cobordism Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://wwwmath.uni-muenster.de/u/jeber_02/skripten/bordism-skript.pdf"} pdf
